WebKit2's IPC on Nebula (docs/w7.md W7a).

An attachment is a capability, counted (WTF's KosmosCapability); a
connection's handle is its ring's region, the endpoint its side receives
on, the one it sends to, and whether that side made them; a semaphore is
an endpoint. Every branch is OS(KOSMOS), beside Unix's, Darwin's and
Windows's - and the drawing area's layer tree host, which on Kosmos is
never made (no compositing); the files they name are Kosmos's own
(runtime/ports/webkit/Source/WebKit/Platform/IPC/kosmos/).

